{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現時正於內地忙於拍攝新劇《模範律師團》的陳煒（煒哥），每逢不用開工，便會爭取時間回港陪伴丈夫。日前，煒哥在網上分享了一碗麵的照片，原來是其丈夫陳醫生親自下廚，為她準備的愛心晚餐，令煒哥感到十分窩心。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">陳煒在社交平台發文感慨：「睇劇成日聽到煮碗麵畀你食，其實一啲都唔老土，仲好窩心。」她更公開大讚老公的廚藝進步神速：「這一個月，每次有機會返香港，陳醫生都會煮碗麵畀我食，今次仲加隻蛋，廚藝真係進步不少。」言談間流露出滿滿的幸福感，足見夫妻二人感情深厚。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8a927fa1-3475-4327-9671-66c91b7414d6.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026h4K5euaG2j1784282564.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8a927fa1-3475-4327-9671-66c91b7414d6.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"92735948-4d78-4cf5-8a91-48fa0b768e25.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026ZM2iWtTHAe1784282570.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"92735948-4d78-4cf5-8a91-48fa0b768e25.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">事實上，陳煒自與陳醫生結婚以來，感情始終如膠似漆。煒哥亦曾多次在訪問中稱讚丈夫細心，即使對方平時不善廚藝，也為了愛妻而努力學習嘗試。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-20T13:05:05.914411+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":292,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}